WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:04.090
Scripture memorization can be
challenging, and I acknowledge

2
00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:06.490
that. It's challenging for me too.

3
00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:11.210
But we call it memorization
because that's the beginning of

4
00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:16.330
the process. We are
committing God's word

5
00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:20.890
to memory. But you remember,
David had a different way of

6
00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:22.170
thinking about that.

7
00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:26.810
He thought about it as
hiding scripture in his

8
00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.650
heart. Isn't that
a beautiful thing?

9
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:31.450
And that's what you
are doing today.

10
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.850
I pray that this fuel session is
just giving you what you need,

11
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:39.850
getting you ready for the
workout today called life.

12
00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:44.090
Come back tomorrow and
let's fuel our souls again.

13
00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:46.650
Heavenly Father, thank
you for today, Lord.

14
00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:48.490
Just thank you for this time.

15
00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:50.490
God, we want to trust in you.

16
00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:54.330
And Lord, we recognize that there
is incredible opportunity to

17
00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:56.890
do that. And Lord, one of the
ways that we're going to trust in

18
00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:59.170
you is we're just going
to internalize your word.

19
00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:03.090
So, God, may your word just be
the fuel that we need today.

20
00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:05.046
In Jesus' name, amen.

